# Lab defaults

This is a Vite + React + TypeScript Chrome app for the ECM SmartKnob. Read `docs/knob-interface.md` before adding a Bluetooth command.

- Connection and parsers live in `src/sdk/`. Demos live in `src/demos/` and receive `sendKnobCommand`.
- Name functions with readable-names: `connectSmartKnob`, `applyHapticMode`, `parseStatusLine`.
- Chrome on macOS is the first browser. Web Bluetooth needs a click.
- Detent mode has one stiffness for every click unless we send a new settings line.
